WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:06.560
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:07.560
"'The sound of splashing surf in my ears...

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:09.960
"'Memories of a hot summer..."'

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.440
...crazy about you!

00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:48.550
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:58.000
"'Who Will It Be?"'

00:01:58.420 --> 00:01:59.760
I won't let you.

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:02.030
S- stop!

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:04.690
Stop! Stop!

00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:06.360
Get off!

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:22.150
Please wait!

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:26.050
You're letting the memory of your
dead girlfriend cloud your judgment!

00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:29.050
I... will not take her place!

00:02:29.050 --> 00:02:34.620
Please don't do this! I respected you!

00:02:38.390 --> 00:02:42.400
I can't stop myself. I love you.

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:44.890
No! Okayasu!

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:51.340
Ryo couldn't have taken Momo-chan!
Where is he?! Ryo!

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:00.810
No... Why?

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:35.840
W- what'll l do?!

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:39.680
Momo-chan!

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:44.830
Momo-chan...

00:03:46.730 --> 00:03:49.400
What's wrong? Did Ryo
do anything to you?

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:51.700
I... I...

00:03:56.740 --> 00:04:01.680
Okayasu-san!

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:04.010
What happened?

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:07.680
I'm all right. It wasn't serious.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.690
You're bleeding. Who did this to you?!

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:12.950
Not... Momo-chan?

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:16.360
She took me totally by surprise.

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:22.700
She came at me suddenly and
when I rejected her, she got upset.

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:26.370
I got pushed back and
the desk came falling on me.

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:32.380
You were absolutely right. I never
imagined she'd come after me.

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:34.140
I'm sorry about earlier.

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:39.720
Momo-chan, you wait here.

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:42.720
But if he's hurt, it's my fault.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:45.450
If he's alive, I'll beat him to a pulp.

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:52.400
He's not here.

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:54.060
I wonder where he went?

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:55.400
Who knows?

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:59.400
But if he walked out on his own,
he wasn't seriously hurt.

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:01.000
Thank goodness!

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:03.670
Have you calmed down?

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:05.340
Uh-huh...

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:09.540
I'm sorry. I'm really, really sorry.

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:16.580
I'm glad nothing
happened to you, Momo-chan.

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:19.690
I was so scared!

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:22.890
I never thought your brother
would try such a thing!

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:25.700
It's all over.

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:29.190
I'm sorry, Okayasu. I'm so sorry!

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:38.370
Please return this to
your brother for me, Okayasu.

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:46.050
I can't return his feelings, and I can't
take the place of his dead girlfriend.

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:51.390
Huh?! I've never heard
that Ryo's girlfriend died!

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:55.390
Before Morika, he went out
with the girl he took from me.

00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:56.390
Huh?

00:05:56.390 --> 00:06:00.330
But he said he loved me
because I resembled her.

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:07.340
What?! He said he loved you, Momo-chan?!
And yet he always criticizes my taste!

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:09.340
Even earlier...

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:12.340
Leave her... leave that girl!

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:15.510
I asked her to come with me,
and she followed so easily.

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:17.350
She's played the field quite a bit.

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:20.710
If you hadn't come,
we'd be upstairs by now...

00:06:22.350 --> 00:06:25.350
Then when he said he loved me,
that was a lie?

00:06:25.350 --> 00:06:28.360
He just wanted to see me squirm.

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:32.030
Even what he said about dating
Morika-san before you, Okayasu?

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:35.360
He even told you that?!
Cripes, I can't believe that guy!

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:38.370
Get this straight! I was
the first one to date her!

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:45.710
Y- your brother really is like Sae.
I didn't see through him.

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:49.380
Everything he said was so nice...

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:53.720
And even when I was upset with Sae,
talking to your brother calmed me down.

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:57.050
And that's it... his trick.

00:06:57.050 --> 00:06:58.720
--And...
--And?

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:04.520
Okayasu, he is your brother, after all, so...
I may've seen him as the future you.

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:10.330
I won't ever be like him.

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:14.270
Uh-huh... Okayasu,
you stay just the way you are.

00:07:16.340 --> 00:07:17.670
Wait!

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:20.680
I was kissed by your brother...

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:21.680
Kissed?!

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:26.020
I'm sorry! You wouldn't want to touch
my lips after your brother kissed me!

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:28.850
Well, your lips need to
be sanitized thoroughly.

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:37.290
l love you...

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:40.800
...Okayasu.

00:07:42.030 --> 00:07:45.030
Thank goodness your injury wasn't serious.

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:49.370
Thank you. I'm really grateful
that you were with me, Sae-chan.

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:51.040
I didn't do anything...

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:56.710
No, no... You were like
my guardian angel back there, Sae-chan.

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:58.200
Oh yes...

00:07:59.380 --> 00:08:00.910
This is in gratitude for today...

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:05.650
For me?

00:08:05.650 --> 00:08:07.250
I'll put it on for you.

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:13.000
Darn, I'm so late!

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:15.660
No open lockers.

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:17.670
There's one open here.

00:08:17.670 --> 00:08:19.160
Oh, thank you.

00:08:25.010 --> 00:08:28.010
Sae!

00:08:28.010 --> 00:08:29.680
Sae! That necklace!

00:08:29.680 --> 00:08:32.350
Momo-chan, Ryo-sama whom you love...

00:08:32.350 --> 00:08:35.020
...is mine!

00:08:35.020 --> 00:08:36.690
Did you and he?!

00:08:36.690 --> 00:08:41.690
We're going to see each other from now.
He called me his guardian angel!

00:08:41.690 --> 00:08:45.690
Don't be silly! Not that guy!
Don't you be fooled, too!

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:49.030
Hah! Just because he didn't
give you the time of day...

00:08:49.030 --> 00:08:54.700
Oh puhleez! Who'd want a guy like that?!
And besides, you have Toji!

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:57.040
Oh, Toji...

00:08:57.040 --> 00:09:01.980
Lately, it's gotten bothersome...
or boring. I can take him or leave him.

00:09:01.980 --> 00:09:02.980
You!

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:07.320
Oh, I know! You can
have him back, Momo-chan!

00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:09.650
Oh, oh... you want him?

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:12.660
Are you kidding? I care about Okayasu!

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:14.050
Hmm...

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:18.330
Well then, if I set my sights
on both Toji and Ryo-sama,

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:20.660
you won't care, right Momo-chan?

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:22.260
See you!

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.670
Ryo and Sae-chan?!

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:29.340
Uh-huh...

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:32.010
Man, talk about the
world's scariest couple.

00:09:32.010 --> 00:09:35.340
Sae's being ridiculous,
but what about your brother?!

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:38.250
How many of those necklaces
does he have anyway?

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:43.450
All right. I'm going to my brother's office.

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:48.020
He called to say he wasn't
coming home for awhile.

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:51.360
There's last night's incident as well.
We really need to talk and settle this.

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:53.360
Then I'm coming.

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:58.030
I want to hear why he
decided to start seeing Sae.

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:00.040
Are you sure about this, Momo-chan?

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:02.040
Yes, as long as you're with me, Okayasu.

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:07.380
Oh yeah... Momo-chan, I forgot
to give this to you. Here.

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:13.050
It's pepper spray. If he ever tries
anything funny, spray Ryo with that.

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:15.520
Thank you, Okayasu!

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:20.060
Okayasu-kun? He was here
just a while ago.

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:21.720
May we wait?

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:23.060
Of course.

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:27.400
He's so late!

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:30.400
Maybe he found out
we were here and snuck away.

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:32.300
I'm going to the ladies' room.

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:45.840
I can see you in the mirror, Big Brother.

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.750
Pepper spray? That's a
dangerous thing you have there.

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:53.420
You're the dangerous one!
This is the ladies' room!

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:56.760
All right. I'm sorry about yesterday.

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:58.760
Momo-chan, you're so cute,
I couldn't help myself.

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:01.360
Did you tell Sae the same thing?

00:11:01.360 --> 00:11:05.030
Oh, you knew about her?
Sae-chan's very talkative, isn't she?

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:09.040
Why Sae? If it's just a whim,
break it off!

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:13.040
Break it off? I just kissed her one time.

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:16.050
Sorry! I'll never go near Sae-chan again!

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:19.380
Everything you told me
were lies, weren't they?

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:24.390
Okayasu told me. Did you really
steal all the girls he went out with?

00:11:24.390 --> 00:11:25.050
Well, yes.

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:29.390
Why would you do such a thing?
Do you hate Okayasu?

00:11:29.390 --> 00:11:33.400
No such thing! I couldn't
have a nicer kid brother.

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:37.070
He's so cute... I can't help but be mean.

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:39.070
He's so perverted!

00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:44.070
Did Morika-san hit you because
you tried the same thing with her?

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:46.080
Well, probably.

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:50.410
Okayasu was really right.
You are the pits!

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:57.090
That's cruel. I admit I'm fast with women.
But I do have my good points, you know?

00:11:57.090 --> 00:11:58.420
Good points?

00:11:58.420 --> 00:12:02.020
When it comes to someone I truly love,
I'm too scared to make a move.

00:12:04.690 --> 00:12:09.700
I'm like Kairi in some ways, huh?
We're brothers, after all. So we're alike.

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:10.700
Huh?

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:15.700
Aren't you frustrated, Momo-chan?
That he doesn't try anything with you?

00:12:15.700 --> 00:12:18.710
That's why I wanted to be nice to you.

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:23.050
What are you saying?! Okayasu always...

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:26.720
Why am I discussing this with you?!

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:29.880
Hey, don't move! I'm going
to call Okayasu right now.

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:33.390
Hello? It's me.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:38.060
Huh? Where are you now?
The ladies' room?! I'll be right there!

00:12:38.060 --> 00:12:40.400
He's coming.

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:44.400
Momo-chan... Does Kairi
really get close to you?

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:47.740
You're so persistent! Yes, he does!

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:51.040
Then, you're not the one
that Kairi's truly in love with.

00:12:52.070 --> 00:12:54.080
He can't still be?

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:56.010
Huh? What?

00:13:00.350 --> 00:13:04.250
Bye-bye, Momo-chan! If you're
ever lonely, come to me!

00:13:09.020 --> 00:13:10.030
Where's Ryo?!

00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:12.030
He just left.

00:13:12.030 --> 00:13:14.700
That guy! You're really all right?

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:15.700
Yes.

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:18.530
The nerve of him!
Coming into the ladies' room!

00:13:31.710 --> 00:13:35.720
l shouldn't let his words bother me...

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:38.050
But there's something about what he said...

00:13:38.050 --> 00:13:40.060
We're done here.

00:13:40.060 --> 00:13:42.060
We're going to empty the trash.

00:13:42.060 --> 00:13:43.790
Thank you!

00:13:45.730 --> 00:13:47.400
You seem glum.

00:13:47.400 --> 00:13:50.070
Something bothering you?

00:13:50.070 --> 00:13:52.400
That necklace.

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:57.410
Oh, Okayasu-kun gave it to me...
Oh, it doesn't mean a thing.

00:13:57.410 --> 00:14:03.350
It was all I had to accessorize this blouse.
I really haven't seen Okayasu-kun lately.

00:14:03.350 --> 00:14:05.010
I saw him yesterday.

00:14:05.010 --> 00:14:08.020
Oh? Where? How is Okayasu-kun?

00:14:08.020 --> 00:14:13.360
Yes... he was fine...
But shouldn't you stay away from him?

00:14:13.360 --> 00:14:16.360
It seems he gives that necklace
to every girl he meets.

00:14:16.360 --> 00:14:20.360
Misao-chan, didn't he try to
seduce you with that necklace?

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:26.370
No way! Okayasu-kun would never try
such a thing. Why would you say that?

00:14:26.370 --> 00:14:28.040
No...

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:30.370
From personal experience.

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:34.040
Okayasu said that his brother
always fools girls with that trick.

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:38.380
Not him again! Why does he
always badmouth his brother?

00:14:38.380 --> 00:14:41.380
Misao-chan, he really didn't
try anything with you?

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:42.870
Of course not!

00:14:44.390 --> 00:14:48.390
When it comes to someone l truly love,
l'm too scared to make a move.

00:14:48.390 --> 00:14:52.350
Huh? Could his brother be in love with?

00:14:55.060 --> 00:14:57.120
What's the matter, Kashiwagi-san?

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:05.670
Ryo-sama cancelled our date today!

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:06.340
Huh?

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:08.680
You told him to break up with me?!

00:15:08.680 --> 00:15:11.680
Just because he dumped you,
you didn't have to get back at me!

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:13.680
Hold it! Let's go somewhere else.

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:18.350
Let go! I never want to speak to you again!

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:20.420
If you try anything like this again,

00:15:20.420 --> 00:15:23.360
I'll make it so you can
never come back to school!

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:26.700
Ryo-sama? Did she mean Okayasu-kun?

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:31.030
Stupid Sae! Why'd she leave after
dropping a bombshell like that?!

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:34.470
I don't think they're
going steady or anything.

00:15:34.470 --> 00:15:38.040
He was just nice to her,
and Sae's giddy over him.

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:39.370
I see.

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:42.540
Oh, but I don't think Big Brother has
any intention of going out with her.

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:44.050
So Sae will cool off soon.

00:15:44.050 --> 00:15:47.240
I understand. But it's
none of my business.

00:15:53.060 --> 00:15:55.060
Man, this weather sucks!

00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:57.730
It was supposed to start raining tonight.

00:15:57.730 --> 00:15:59.750
It doesn't look like it'll let up.

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:02.660
W- what?

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:06.000
Err... Momo-chan, your mascara's running.

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:09.000
Ack! Why?!

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:11.670
Hey, don't look!

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:13.010
Momo-chan, you're so cute.

00:16:13.010 --> 00:16:16.010
Oh... I can't go home looking like this.

00:16:16.010 --> 00:16:19.010
My house is close by. Wanna come?

00:16:19.010 --> 00:16:21.350
Here... a towel and a change of clothes.

00:16:21.350 --> 00:16:23.020
You can shower, if you like.

00:16:23.020 --> 00:16:24.020
No...

00:16:24.020 --> 00:16:29.690
Don't worry. Both my parents work and
aren't home during the day. Take your time.

00:16:33.360 --> 00:16:37.700
l came home with him... And it's just
the two of us in this house.

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:41.230
Anything could happen.

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:47.300
What'll l do?! l feel so nervous.

00:16:51.380 --> 00:16:54.380
That was fast. You didn't shower?

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:59.720
Err... no... I thought it's rude to
shower in a house I've never been in.

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:03.330
Hmm... that's a weird thing to worry about.

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:05.330
Hey, don't sit way over there.
Come in here.

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:08.000
I'm going home as soon
as my clothes are dry.

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.330
Don't be embarrassed! Come on!

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:13.000
Why is sex the only thing on your mind?!

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:16.670
Then, you're not the one
that Kairi's truly in love with.

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:21.180
Shucks... Oh well...
Let's plan our trip then.

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:23.350
Where'd I put the pamphlets?

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:27.350
Why do those words bother me so much?

00:17:27.350 --> 00:17:29.020
Momo-chan?

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:31.690
Why're you in such a daze?

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:33.690
Don't you want to go?

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:36.020
You don't seem too enthusiastic.

00:17:36.020 --> 00:17:41.030
It's not that. I was just thinking.

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:48.040
Okayasu, do you ever worry about what
others say, and start to doubt someone?

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:51.040
Sure. Of course. I'm always doubting.

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:52.370
Really?

00:17:52.370 --> 00:17:59.380
Girls have always betrayed me. Every girl
I started seeing ended up with Ryo.

00:17:59.380 --> 00:18:02.650
I still wonder why I am here sometimes.

00:18:02.650 --> 00:18:09.660
You, too, Okayasu? To me,
you're always so together.

00:18:09.660 --> 00:18:14.000
No way. The things I really
want are always so unreachable.

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:15.930
Things you really want?

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:19.470
Yeah.

00:18:28.010 --> 00:18:33.350
Okayasu... did l make you
doubt yourself, too?

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:36.410
Err... Aren't you going
to resist, Momo-chan?

00:18:38.020 --> 00:18:41.360
Not with you, Okayasu.

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:46.030
I never said it, did I?

00:18:46.030 --> 00:18:48.930
Okayasu, I love you.

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:55.690
When did l start loving Okayasu so much?

00:18:56.710 --> 00:18:59.400
l love you... so much.

00:19:05.650 --> 00:19:06.310
Hey...

00:19:06.310 --> 00:19:08.320
I'm sorry.

00:19:08.320 --> 00:19:09.990
Let's not.

00:19:09.990 --> 00:19:11.320
Not?

00:19:11.320 --> 00:19:14.320
Did I do something to upset you?

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:18.660
It's not your fault, Momo-chan. Sorry.

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:20.000
How rude of him!

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:26.000
When I had made up my mind! Stupid!
Stupid! Stupid! How could he say sorry?!

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:32.340
l'm so embarrassed, l could die!
He rejected me! l'm so shocked!

00:19:32.340 --> 00:19:37.040
Or... did he change his mind
because he loves me?

00:19:38.680 --> 00:19:41.310
He... cherishes me.

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:52.690
Oh... no... l can't talk to him.
But l have to go in and say hi at least.

00:19:52.690 --> 00:19:54.700
Okayasu!

00:19:54.700 --> 00:19:55.790
Good morning!

00:19:58.030 --> 00:20:00.700
Did he just ignore me?!

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:03.710
Okayasu, let's have lunch...

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:05.940
Hey, what's with that attitude?!

00:20:08.380 --> 00:20:10.710
Okayasu! Why are you avoiding me?!

00:20:10.710 --> 00:20:12.380
Huh? I'm not...

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:17.050
Liar! You kept walking away.
If something's bothering you, tell me!

00:20:17.050 --> 00:20:22.060
C'mon, as if I'd avoid you,
Momo-chan. Don't be mad.

00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:24.390
Then let's walk home together.

00:20:24.390 --> 00:20:27.530
Sorry, I need to do something
for my parents today.

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:29.360
I'll see you tomorrow. 'Bye!

00:20:32.730 --> 00:20:36.670
Something's wrong.
Okayasu's not his usual self.

00:20:38.410 --> 00:20:42.080
We planted a peach pit here.

00:20:42.080 --> 00:20:47.080
Then little by little,
my heart opened up to Okayasu.

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:50.090
And it's in full bloom now.

00:20:50.090 --> 00:20:52.090
Hello!

00:20:52.090 --> 00:20:53.760
Misao-chan!

00:20:53.760 --> 00:20:55.090
Come on in.

00:20:55.090 --> 00:20:58.430
Thank you, Misao-chan, for lending an ear.

00:20:58.430 --> 00:21:02.360
No problem. I'm going to change,
so just make yourself at home.

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:03.560
Thank you.

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:10.370
Misao-chan, may I look
at your photographs?

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:11.770
Go right ahead.

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:17.050
You're so cute, Misao-chan!

00:21:17.050 --> 00:21:21.050
The guy next to you is
the pits, but... Oh, Okayasu!

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:27.250
When she used to tutor him.
So cute... and so young.

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:32.730
Here you are.

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:35.400
That was taken when
I went on a summer trip

00:21:35.400 --> 00:21:36.400
with the two Okayasu brothers.

00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:40.070
Kairi disappeared on the way home,
and there was such a panic.

00:21:40.070 --> 00:21:41.400
Coming!

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:43.410
Why? What happened?

00:21:43.410 --> 00:21:44.740
You're here again?

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:47.740
Whaddya mean "'again"'? Can't I come?

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:49.840
I'm hungry. Do you have anything to eat?

00:21:53.420 --> 00:21:55.350
Do you come here often?

00:21:57.750 --> 00:22:00.360
I saw Misao-chan's photo album.

00:22:00.360 --> 00:22:03.020
The same one you had
in your school planner, Okayasu.

00:22:03.020 --> 00:22:08.830
I thought it was Morika-san...
But that was actually Misao-chan.

00:22:10.370 --> 00:22:14.030
Does that mean you still love Misao-chan?

00:22:15.700 --> 00:22:18.200
Well? Tell me, Okayasu!

00:22:19.040 --> 00:22:21.040
Uh-huh.

00:22:21.040 --> 00:22:22.130
I'm sorry.

00:22:37.090 --> 00:22:43.100
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:43.100 --> 00:22:52.780
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.780 --> 00:22:55.780
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.780 --> 00:23:02.390
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.390 --> 00:23:08.730
Where can we go

00:23:08.730 --> 00:23:18.400
where we can all be

00:23:18.400 --> 00:23:21.070
under the same sky?

00:23:21.070 --> 00:23:29.410
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.410 --> 00:23:36.090
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:36.090 --> 00:23:42.430
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.430 --> 00:23:49.770
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.770 --> 00:23:57.470
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:04.710
What are you saying? lf we break up,
Okayasu, l'm going to cry!

00:24:04.710 --> 00:24:07.380
l'll cry my eyes out every day.

00:24:07.380 --> 00:24:11.390
Okayasu, why can't it be me you love?

00:24:11.390 --> 00:24:14.620
Next on Peach Girl,
"'When Love Reaches Rock Bottom"'
